Subject: [PATCH] ProofScope v0.9: certified drift localization (CMCD);
 verified Lean setup

- DriftExtract.lean: edit sites of elaborated statements, chain of hybrids,
  per-occurrence shared-operator abstraction
- DriftSoundness.lean: localization/composition theorems (7 axiom-free) and
  the cancellation counterexample (standard axioms); fresh replay
- cmcd.py: per-edit and global certificates (entailment, countermodels,
  antecedent-using law rewriting), localized verdicts only under theorems
- Suites: cmcd_v09_dev (21; block 1 run 16/21 with 1 wrong, 21/21 after
  fixes), cmcd_v09_adversarial (6; 0 false equivalences; 2 author label
  errors recorded), blind-suite protocol for an independent author
- .github/actions/setup-lean: pinned SHA-256, retries, cache, fail-closed
  INFRASTRUCTURE_ERROR; used by Engine, ClaimDelta, CMCD workflows
- Removed stray v0.8 patch file from repository root

